{"id":2716,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>5月20日下午我院在15105ZH教室举办俊彦讲坛。本次讲坛由我院青年博士郭倩老师主讲，研一、研二全体学生参加。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=HL7CgYL4CYozlDULNQ2UmQkMzTVolLMsnlWkM46VnmM2MlC0gihFp2hmCIa0oSyDU1h2MYy8M7V7nl-8LNLsL4nVnRGaozUiL4UsM7MRL7rFMN-aLNn2UlMFLl7ZoRlJv2bjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4vPLzlJqdonx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7115&e=.png\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/96BF744ADEB42C734ED009453474CC0E/6B02DFAC/1A885\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 515px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=HL7CgYL4CYozlDULNQ2UmQkMzTVolLMsnlWkM46VnmM2MlC0gihFp2hmCIa0oSyDU1h2MYy8M7V7nl-8LNLsL4nVnRGaozUiL4UsM7MRL7rFMN-aLNn2UlMFLl7ZoRlJv2bjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4vPLzlJqdonx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7115&e=.png\"></p><p>郭老师围绕硕士论文写作核心要点展开，明确选题基本准则，引导同学们精准定位研究领域，树立明确研究思路，规避选题空泛等写作通病。同时，她分享文献梳理积累与学术素养提升的实用方法，规范智能辅助工具的使用尺度，反复叮嘱全体学子严守学术规范，坚守学术诚信底线。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=HMlQgRLmVVUNW7oLRVkMlMkoRA2nzlMDU4W2UznkL7MVM4N0gihFp2hmCIa0n1yDL1yYLSyDn7CZLRvPLz-4M7C8MRCZnN7YnlC8MzAVUmMFM4N4olLPMNrFLmn2nmCJv2bjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4vPLzlJqdonx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7115&e=.png\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/F62216DF80711234F4468FA2EF458EB3/7939C16E/24FF6\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 502px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=HMlQgRLmVVUNW7oLRVkMlMkoRA2nzlMDU4W2UznkL7MVM4N0gihFp2hmCIa0n1yDL1yYLSyDn7CZLRvPLz-4M7C8MRCZnN7YnlC8MzAVUmMFM4N4olLPMNrFLmn2nmCJv2bjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4vPLzlJqdonx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7115&e=.png\"></p><p>本次讲坛内容详实、指导性强，帮助同学们理清了论文写作框架，明晰了创作方向，切实为后续规范撰写、高质量完成学位论文提供了实操指导。<br></p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://mkszyxy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=HL7CgYL4CYozlDULNQ2UmQkMzTVolLMsnlWkM46VnmM2MlC0gihFp2hmCIa0oSyDU1h2MYy8M7V7nl-8LNLsL4nVnRGaozUiL4UsM7MRL7rFMN-aLNn2UlMFLl7ZoRlJv2bjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4vPLzlJqdonx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7115&e=.png"}